{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"id\":\"N56\",\"lines\":\"n-n\"}\n{\"id\":\"N56.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The speech sounds like counsel over how this people should be treated. Their presence makes the choice a matter under discussion.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قاوَلْتُهُ sense is negotiating about an affair; قَوْمًا names the people whose treatment is at stake. They meet through the subject of the discussion.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N56.2\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N56.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"Good treatment becomes one subject of the speech. The utterance frames how the people may be treated.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قاوَلْتُهُ sense is discussion about an affair; حُسْنًا is goodness offered as one course of action. The link is the topic of deliberation, not a shared meaning.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N57\",\"lines\":\"r-r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N57.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The divine speech sounds like a judgment placed in the ruler’s hands. The people are the ones over whom that judgment will be carried out.\",\"reason\":\"The rare اقتال عليه sense is imposing a judgment on another; قَوْمًا names the people facing the choice. Together they picture authority issuing a ruling over a community.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N57.2\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N57.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"Good treatment is one judgment he may impose. The choice makes goodness a concrete outcome of the authority granted to him.\",\"reason\":\"The rare اقتال عليه sense is imposing a judgment; حُسْنًا names the good conduct offered as one branch. That treatment is a possible content of the imposed judgment.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N58\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N59\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N60\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N61\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N62\",\"lines\":\"-n-rn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N62.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"بَلَغَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N62.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The eye-pressure in عَيْنٍ can suggest the gaze through which care is shown. The spring remains the verse’s plain image.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قَوْلٌ sense is sincere concern; عَيْنٍ carries the image of a seeing eye as well as a spring. A gaze can be one means of attending to what matters.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N62.3\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"عِندَهَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N62.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The people become recipients of care, not merely an encountered crowd. The choice places responsibility for them at the center of the address.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قَوْلٌ sense is sincere concern for something; قَوْمًا names the people over whom Dhul-Qarnayn is given a choice. Concern and care for a community meet in the decision about their treatment.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N62.5\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"after\":\"The title’s sense of things joined can suggest attachment. The rare sense of concern gives that bond an emotional coloring.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قَوْلٌ sense is sincere care; قَرْن can mean joining one thing to another. Care can resemble attachment, though the title itself does not state an emotion.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N63\",\"lines\":\"rrn-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N63.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"بَلَغَ\",\"after\":\"Reaching the setting-place sounds like arriving at a defined boundary. The rare sense lets the endpoint feel both reached and named.\",\"reason\":\"The rare technical sense of قَوْلٌ is a definition or حد; بَلَغَ means reaching an endpoint. Both meet in the idea of a limit.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N63.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"The west is heard as the sun’s boundary, the place where its course meets an edge. The traveler reaches that edge as though arriving at a definition of the horizon.\",\"reason\":\"The rare technical sense of قَوْلٌ is a thing’s حد, its defining boundary; مَغْرِبَ is the sun’s setting-place. Their shared edge makes the western horizon a defined limit in the scene.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N63.3\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"after\":\"A definition can make something recognizable. The verb وَجَدَهَا names the finding of what has been identified.\",\"reason\":\"The rare technical sense of قَوْلٌ is a definition; وَجَدَهَا means finding or perceiving. A definition can help identify what one finds, though this link is only a faint echo here.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N63.4\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N64\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N65\",\"lines\":\"----\"}\n{\"id\":\"N66\",\"lines\":\"-r-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N66.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N66.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The title’s rare sense gives Dhul-Qarnayn the capacity to face what confronts him. Here the people are the ones over whom he must exercise that capacity.\",\"reason\":\"The rare مُقْرِن sense is being able to withstand or master something; قَوْمًا names the community placed under his decision. The scene gives that capacity a human object.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N66.3\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N67\",\"lines\":\"-r-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N67.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N67.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The rare sense of a generation brings the title close to the people he encounters. The community can be heard as a people joined in one time.\",\"reason\":\"قَرْن can mean a people belonging to one era; قَوْمًا means a collective of people. These senses overlap directly in the human group at the journey’s endpoint.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N67.3\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N68\",\"lines\":\"-rr--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N68.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N68.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"after\":\"The title can faintly cast the sun as a body with a horn or crest. The sun’s upper edge becomes part of the image carried by the title.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قَرْن sense includes قرن الشمس, the sun’s uppermost or first-visible part; ٱلشَّمْسِ names the sun itself. The horn or crest is a part of the solar body.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N68.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَغْرُبُ\",\"after\":\"The sun’s first-visible horn stands beside its setting. The title carries an image of the sun’s beginning while تَغْرُبُ names its withdrawal.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قرن الشمس sense is the sun’s uppermost part as it first appears; تَغْرُبُ is the sun setting. First appearance and disappearance face opposite ends of the solar course.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N68.4\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N68.5\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N69\",\"lines\":\"_____\"}\n{\"id\":\"N70\",\"lines\":\"___\"}\n{\"id\":\"N71\",\"lines\":\"--r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N71.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N71.2\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N71.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"The inner self is joined to the body, while the divine utterance is expressed outwardly. Heard together, inward being and spoken word form two sides of the scene.\",\"reason\":\"The rare قَرْن sense is the self paired with the body; قُلْنَا is speech brought into utterance. The inner self and the expressed word complement one another as inward and outward.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N72\",\"lines\":\"____\"}\n{\"id\":\"N73\",\"lines\":\"-rrn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N73.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N73.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The spring can be heard as a source of pleasant drinking water. That sweetness sits beneath the verse’s darker image of a muddy spring.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذْب sense is sweet, agreeable water or drink; عَيْنٍ is a flowing-water source. A spring can supply the sweet water, even as حَمِئَةٍ darkens this particular scene.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N73.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"حَمِئَةٍ\",\"after\":\"Sweet, pleasant water is set against black foul mud. The spring holds both the pull of drink and the image of something dark and altered.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذْب sense is good-tasting, potable water; حَمِئَةٍ describes black, foul-smelling water mud. Their qualities oppose one another within the same spring scene.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N73.4\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"Pleasant taste and moral goodness share a positive coloring. The link remains broad because one is flavor and the other is conduct.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذْب sense is طَيِّب, pleasant or good; حُسْنًا names goodness and doing good. Their favorable evaluation overlaps without making the meanings identical.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N74\",\"lines\":\"___\"}\n{\"id\":\"N75\",\"lines\":\"-nr\"}\n{\"id\":\"N75.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عِندَهَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N75.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"The rare sense of withholding can faintly answer the utterance that opens the choice. The contrast is between restraint from speech and speech itself.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذَّبَ branch can mean refraining or preventing; قُلْنَا is spoken utterance. Restraint from speaking opposes the act of saying, though that contrast is thin in this verse.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N75.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"One branch can be heard as holding back, while the other adopts goodness. The alternatives then sound like withholding set against taking up a good course.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذَّبَ branch means refraining or preventing; تَتَّخِذَ means adopting or acquiring. Withholding and taking up an action oppose one another.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N76\",\"lines\":\"rr-r-\"}\n{\"id\":\"N76.1\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"مَغْرِبَ\",\"after\":\"The setting-place can be pictured as an open expanse under the sky. The rare sense adds an unobstructed horizon to the scene of sunset.\",\"reason\":\"The rare العَذوب sense is something with no cover between it and the sky; مَغْرِبَ names the sun’s setting-place. Together they form an image of an exposed western horizon.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N76.2\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلشَّمْسِ\",\"after\":\"The rare sense of exposure to the sky can faintly accompany the sun. This is a natural but broad association.\",\"reason\":\"The rare العَذوب sense is being uncovered to the sky; ٱلشَّمْسِ names the sun. Sun and open sky belong together, though the pairing adds little by itself.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N76.3\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N76.4\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"The spring can be pictured as an opening exposed to the sky. That open aperture deepens the image of the sun setting into the water-source.\",\"reason\":\"The rare العَذوب sense is something with no shelter from the sky; عَيْنٍ can mean a spring or an aperture. Their meeting makes the spring an open, sky-facing place.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N76.5\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"وَوَجَدَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N77\",\"lines\":\"-rrn\"}\n{\"id\":\"N77.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N77.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"The rare sense locates the utterance at the tip of the tongue. The tongue’s small end becomes the instrument of saying.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذَبَ branch is عذبة اللسان, the tongue’s tip; قُلْنَا is spoken utterance. That tip is a bodily part involved in speech.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N77.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ\",\"after\":\"A hanging strap or small attached end can be heard beside the title’s sense of joining. The loose piece becomes part of what binds things together.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذَبَ branch is a dangling end or attached thong; قَرْن can mean joining one thing to another. The hanging piece is a small part that can participate in the joining.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N77.4\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"after\":\"A dangling loop can serve as a grip by which something is taken. The connection is practical and slight.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذَبَ branch names a hanging strap or thread; تَتَّخِذَ means taking or adopting. A strap can be the part used to take hold of an object, though this is not explicit in the verse.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N78\",\"lines\":\"--r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N78.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"بَلَغَ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N78.2\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N78.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"Generous character and doing good fall under the same moral light. The goodness branch can sound like the outward form of that generosity.\",\"reason\":\"The rare عَذَبي sense is noble or generous character; حُسْنًا names goodness and treating others well. The two meanings overlap as virtuous conduct.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N79\",\"lines\":\"---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N80\",\"lines\":\"n---\"}\n{\"id\":\"N80.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"وَجَدَهَا\",\"after\":\"Finding can be heard as the discovery that comes before taking or adopting. The verbs suggest successive stages, though they concern different things here.\",\"reason\":\"The rare أَخَذَ sense is to acquire or take hold; وَجَدَهَا means finding or encountering. Discovery can precede acquisition, but the verse does not make them one act.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N80.2\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عِندَهَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N80.3\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N80.4\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N81\",\"lines\":\"-rr\"}\n{\"id\":\"N81.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N81.2\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"after\":\"Holding someone accountable for sin can lead into punishment. The rare sense makes the punitive branch sound like an answer to culpability.\",\"reason\":\"The rare آخَذَهُ بذنبه sense is holding someone responsible for a sin; تُعَذِّبَ is punitive action. Accountability for wrongdoing can be the ground or stage that leads to punishment.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N81.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"opposite\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"حُسْنًا\",\"after\":\"Responsibility for sin stands against the good conduct offered as the other course. The choice makes blame and goodness opposing moral outcomes.\",\"reason\":\"The rare آخَذَهُ بذنبه sense is accountability for wrongdoing; حُسْنًا names goodness and treating others well. Culpability and virtue point in opposite moral directions.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N82\",\"lines\":\"--r\"}\n{\"id\":\"N82.1\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"image\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"عَيْنٍ\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N82.2\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N82.3\",\"verdict\":\"reading\",\"relation\":\"part\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"تُعَذِّبَ\",\"after\":\"Capturing people can become one form of punitive treatment. The rare branch gives the punishment option a sharper image of confinement.\",\"reason\":\"The rare أَخَذَ sense is seizing someone as a captive; تُعَذِّبَ means punishing or causing pain. Captivity can be a means or form of punishment.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N83\",\"lines\":\"----\"}\n{\"id\":\"N84\",\"lines\":\"n--\"}\n{\"id\":\"N84.1\",\"verdict\":\"note\",\"relation\":\"complement\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قَوْمًا\",\"after\":\"The rare land-taking sense can faintly place the community within a ruler’s domain. The verse gives him a choice over the people, though it does not say he takes their land.\",\"reason\":\"The rare الإخاذة sense is land a person or ruler takes for himself; قَوْمًا names the people encountered there. A ruled community can belong to a domain, but the link remains indirect.\"}\n{\"id\":\"N84.2\",\"verdict\":\"nothing\",\"relation\":\"same\",\"focus_ar\":\"تَتَّخِذَ\",\"target_ar\":\"قُلْنَا\",\"after\":\"\",\"reason\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"N84.